    {
      "beat_id": "beat_001",
      "attaches_to": "state",
      "target_id": "state_000",
      "text": "Last time, we clicked the Amount column header in DB Browser for SQLite to sort all 120 Orders rows from highest to lowest.",
      "tts_text": null,
      "word_count": 23,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 0.0,
      "audio_path": null
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_002",
      "attaches_to": "state",
      "target_id": "state_000",
      "text": "Right now we're viewing the Database Structure tab, which shows the tables and columns but not the actual data. That's the opposite of where we need to be to filter records.",
      "tts_text": null,
      "word_count": 31,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 0.0,
      "audio_path": null
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_003",
      "attaches_to": "edge",
      "target_id": "edge_001",
      "text": "Let's click the Browse Data tab so we can work directly with the table rows before filtering.",
      "tts_text": null,
      "word_count": 17,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 0.0,
      "audio_path": null
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_004",
      "attaches_to": "state",
      "target_id": "state_001",
      "text": "The Status column filter box sits empty above its column, ready to accept a value that will narrow the visible rows to matching records.",
      "tts_text": null,
      "word_count": 24,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 0.0,
      "audio_path": null
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_005",
      "attaches_to": "edge",
      "target_id": "edge_002",
      "text": "Click the filter box under the Status column to focus it before typing a value to search for.",
      "tts_text": null,
      "word_count": 18,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 0.0,
      "audio_path": null
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_006",
      "attaches_to": "state",
      "target_id": "state_002",
      "text": "The filter box sits empty and ready, with every row still showing since no value has been typed in yet. Without a filter, the table can't narrow down to what we're looking for.",
      "tts_text": null,
      "word_count": 33,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 0.0,
      "audio_path": null
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_007",
      "attaches_to": "edge",
      "target_id": "edge_003",
      "text": "Type Shipped into the focused filter box under the Status column to search for that value.",
      "tts_text": null,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 0.0,
      "audio_path": null
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_008",
      "attaches_to": "state",
      "target_id": "state_003",
      "text": "The filter box holds the word \"Shipped,\" but the table below still lists every order, unfiltered. The rows on screen don't match that value yet.",
      "tts_text": null,
      "word_count": 25,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 0.0,
      "audio_path": null
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_009",
      "attaches_to": "edge",
      "target_id": "edge_004",
      "text": "Press Return now to apply the filter so the box actually narrows the rows to match.",
      "tts_text": null,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 0.0,
      "audio_path": null
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_010",
      "attaches_to": "state",
      "target_id": "db_browser_sqlite_09e43687eb47",
